 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Try getting up every hour to stand up and stretch for few minutes. It' worth a few short breaks to keep the pain at bay. Try using a small box as step up. Each time you sit down, put one foot on the box and sit down slowly. A slightly bent back is less taxing than straight bent knees. Try a recumbent chair or a desk cut down to sitting position. Try using a desk with a hood over the screen. Many universities provide them. A simple stand under one eye also helps.",
